DESCRIPTION:Django is an inclusive community. We seek to invite contributio
 ns\, and aim for consensus in our decision making. As the project has grow
 n — and as with all large open source projects — that's led to diffic
 ulties\, as even simple proposals get drawn out into long discussions that
  suck time\, energy\, and enthusiasm from all. It's time we refreshed our 
 approach. We're going to look at how we got here\, what we need to maintai
 n\, and how we can move forwards towards a better process.
DTSTAMP:20261116T124016Z
LOCATION:Main hall
SUMMARY:How we make decisions in Django - Carlton Gibson
URL:https://pretalx.evolutio.pt/djangocon-europe-2025/talk/PGBMSR/
